  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& |\\operatorname{adj} A|=|A|^{n-1}=|A|^{2-1}=|A| \\\\\n& \\operatorname{adj}(\\operatorname{adj} A)=|A|^{n-2} A=|A|^0 A=A\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
    "image": null
